  "definition": "Veteran",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.66); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.68); renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.75); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.91), eff 12-1-25",
